.page-title
  %h2= @page_title
  %h4 Nitrous.IO is a cloud application platform that helps you create and configure the infrastructure and services for complex web applications in just seconds.

%h3 Nitrous.IO Boxes

%figure
  = image_tag 'boxes-recent.png'

%p Boxes are the foundation of the Nitrous.IO platform.  Boxes are made up of any combination of web application services, including programming languages, databases, key-value stores, utilities, frameworks and more.  We recommend that each application is run in isolation on its own box.

%h3 Our Investors
:markdown
